  "version": 1,
  "description": "Single registry shared by the browser sync layer and server/entityStore.mjs. Every AppState collection (array of records with an id) maps to one SQL partition in sync.EntityStore; every other plain key is a singleton document in sync.EntitySingleton. Unknown arrays are auto-discovered and use the default policy, so no data can be left without a SQL home.",
